W AX3039 389-unhandled-at-main.ax:70:9-13 axtag-key-typo "AXTAG key typo on `Typo`: unrecognised key `unhandld`; did you mean `unhandled`?" ?"an unrecognised key is recorded and never checked, so the claim this looks like was not made; the keys that are checked are `pure`, `effect(...)`, `restrict(...)` and `unhandled(trap)` on an `effect` declaration"
W AX3053 389-unhandled-at-main.ax:137:6-10 unhandled-operation "`main` reaches operation `ask` of effect `Written` with no handler: the process would write `axiom: unhandled effect` and exit 71 there - main -> viaWritten" #"reaches `Written` with nothing handling it" ^129:6-16:"`viaWritten` performs it" ?"install one - `(handle BODY (E) HANDLER)` around the call - or, if an unhandled operation of this effect is a deliberate abort as `Assert`'s is, write `;@axiom:unhandled(trap)` above its `effect` declaration"
